--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: TheAncanofrontation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733785
    - rid: 268099706744733786
    - rid: 268099706744733787
    - rid: 268099706744733788
    - rid: 268099706744733789
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think Natsuki actually fought a bear?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733790
    - rid: 268099706744733791
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know; from what {mc} said about the Companions that doesn't seem
      <i>too</i> out of the ordinary.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733792
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Surely they must've sent help along with her if she really is supposed
      to take down a bear, though.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733793
    - rid: 268099706744733794
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733796
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh. You're probably right, Yuri!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733797
    - rid: 268099706744733798
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be <i>really</i> irresponsible if they sent out a single person
      take down an entire bear-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733799
    - rid: 268099706744733800
    - rid: 268099706744733805
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: You two! Stop right there!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733801
    - rid: 268099706744733802
    - rid: 268099706744733806
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is there something wrong, mister?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733803
    - rid: 268099706744733804
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye, some strange magical-something-or-others have been coming down from
      the college.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733808
    - rid: 268099706744733809
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: Those stupid mages have been saying it's the fault of some filthy Thalmor-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: (As if <i>that's</i> what Skyrim needs, mages and elves in the same room...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733810
    - rid: 268099706744733811
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: But anyway, regardless of whose fault it is, it's dangerous.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733812
    - rid: 268099706744733813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to worry mister, we're here to help!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733814
    - rid: 268099706744733815
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We've got just the staff that should help with whatever it is Ancano's
      doing!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733816
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, whatever you do, try not to send the rest of this town down into
      the Sea of Ghosts...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099706744733817
    - rid: 268099706744733818
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732480
    - rid: 268099729075732481
    - rid: 268099729075732482
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: There you two are! Where's Savos?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732483
    - rid: 268099729075732484
    - rid: 268099729075732485
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732487
    - rid: 268099729075732488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He sacrificed himself so we could get the Staff of Magnus.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff of Magnus? Hopefully that'll stop whatever Ancano's doing...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b9d3d794309e1848a67c6a6897eddf2, type: 2}
    dialog: The other teachers are currently trying to... contain the effects.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732491
    - rid: 268099729075732492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well we better get to work, then!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732493
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732494
    - rid: 268099729075732495
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Just outside the door to the Hall of Elements lies a strange magical
      barrier.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732496
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Tolfdir and Arniel theorized that the barrier could be disrupted or penetrated
      by offensive magics...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732497
    - rid: 268099729075732498
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: But we don't seem to have the power necessary to-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Would this staff work, Ms. Ervine?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732499
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: By the Eight-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732500
    - rid: 268099729075732501
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, there you two are. What sort of staff do you have-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732502
    - rid: 268099729075732504
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff of Magnus?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732505
    - rid: 268099729075732506
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course that'll work; why do you two have it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: We found it in Labyrinthian, thanks to Mr. Aren's help-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732507
    - rid: 268099729075732509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Where is Savos, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732510
    - rid: 268099729075732511
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Dead. He said that you would be in charge.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, let's just take of this situation first before we sort out the
      leadership restructuring.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732512
    - rid: 268099729075732513
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Go on, use the staff to take care of this... I suppose a ward is the
      best way to describe it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732514
    - rid: 268099729075732515
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As instructed, Sayori uses the Staff of Magnus to dispel the barrier
      produced by Ancano's chicanery.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732516
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright! Let's get in there and stop Ancano while we have the chance!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732517
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732518
    - rid: 268099729075732519
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Stop this madness at once, Ancano!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732522
    - rid: 268099729075732524
    - rid: 268099729075732525
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha! The power to unmake the world at my fingertips, and you deem yourself
      worthy to lecture me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not entirely sure how you were able to penetrate my barrier so quickly,
      but I'd like to see you deal with this-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice! Use the Staff of Magnus on the Eye before he gets the chance!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732526
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh- okay...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732527
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori begins blasting the Eye of Magnus with the power of the Staff.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732528
    - rid: 268099729075732529
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Ack! What are you-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>You have the Staff</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Estormo, you utter cur of an elf!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: No matter!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Despite being cutoff from his power source, thanks to Sayori, Ancano
      still has bountiful residual magical energy in his body.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Using some of that power, he fires an ice spike at Sayori with speeds
      resembling that of a bullet.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732530
    - rid: 268099729075732531
    - rid: 268099729075732532
    - rid: 268099729075732533
    - rid: 268099729075732535
    - rid: 268099729075732536
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ow... ow...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732534
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a good thing Ancano didn't take much time to aim, if he had Sayori
      might be missing a good chunk of her torso.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: There's still a notable absense of where a chunk of her used to be, but
      she's still conscious and can move.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh god...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice, keep using the Staff! We'll defend you from Ancano!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Without much choice in the matter, Sayori does her best to use the Staff
      while propping herself up with it, to minimize the strain on her wound.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732537
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uuhhh... {mc} said that this would be the <i>safest</i> way to get stronger...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732538
    - rid: 268099729075732539
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sayori's nearly died twice now!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732540
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
